There is a trick that you can do that will allow you to continue
playing a copy of a saved game.  You do not have write permission
in the save directory, but you do have write permission on the save
file.  So if you want to re-start your saved copy, you have to save
a bogus game first.  (Just start a game and save it immediately.
Then you can copy your file on top of the one that's there.  Then
you can play away...


